            </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="legal-section__header">How Can I Contact the Hindawi Foundation?</h2>
            <p class="legal-section__body">If you have any queries about our Cookie Policy, please contact us at:</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">
                Hindawi Foundation<br />
